      <div class="zr-cards" role="tabpanel" aria-live="polite"><article class="zr-card on" data-i="0"><span class="zr-card-n">Role 01 / 07</span><h3>Requesting Department</h3><p>Production, quality, packaging or any team that needs something bought.</p><ul><li>Create purchase requests with items and specs</li><li>Edit and resubmit when a request is returned</li><li>Track every request through to award</li></ul></article><article class="zr-card" data-i="1"><span class="zr-card-n">Role 02 / 07</span><h3>Sourcing Officer</h3><p>Turns approved requests into live tenders.</p><ul><li>Create tenders with terms and deadlines</li><li>Invite suppliers and collect their bids</li><li>Run the compliance check on every offer</li></ul></article><article class="zr-card" data-i="2"><span class="zr-card-n">Role 03 / 07</span><h3>Evaluation Committee</h3><p>Four members who score every compliant bid.</p><ul><li>Score technical and financial offers</li><li>Apply the weights set before bidding opened</li><li>Agree on one unified report</li></ul></article><article class="zr-card" data-i="3"><span class="zr-card-n">Role 04 / 07</span><h3>Sourcing Manager</h3><p>Reviews the recommendation before it moves on.</p><ul><li>Approve, reject or return the report</li><li>Escalate high-value tenders</li><li>Follow progress across all tenders</li></ul></article><article class="zr-card" data-i="4"><span class="zr-card-n">Role 05 / 07</span><h3>Top Committee</h3><p>Gives the final word on the biggest decisions.</p><ul><li>Decide on high-value and critical tenders</li><li>Record the decision and its reasons</li><li>Confirm the winning supplier</li></ul></article><article class="zr-card" data-i="5"><span class="zr-card-n">Role 06 / 07</span><h3>Admin</h3><p>Keeps the system set up and running.</p><ul><li>Manage users, roles and departments</li><li>Maintain master data</li><li>Approve new supplier registrations</li></ul></article><article class="zr-card" data-i="6"><span class="zr-card-n">Role 07 / 07</s